WEBVTT

00:40.290 --> 00:45.003
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:11.571 --> 01:12.947
If anything happened to Yul,

01:14.574 --> 01:15.825
Uk will lose control.

01:15.909 --> 01:18.578
This whole time, Uk has
barely contained his anger.

01:19.454 --> 01:20.288
But if…

01:20.914 --> 01:22.749
the Cheonbugwan mages hurt Yul,

01:23.374 --> 01:24.584
Uk may just explode.

01:24.667 --> 01:26.044
I can only pray that nothing--

01:26.127 --> 01:28.129
I know where the gambling den is.
Let me take you there.

01:28.213 --> 01:29.839
We know where the gambling den is located.

01:30.381 --> 01:32.759
But anything could happen,
so please stay here.

01:51.861 --> 01:52.695
Yul.

01:54.447 --> 01:55.448
Yul.

01:57.492 --> 01:58.535
Uk.

02:01.538 --> 02:02.539
I'm sorry.

02:29.566 --> 02:31.234
Not a single person here…

02:32.569 --> 02:33.987
will leave this place alive.

02:51.921 --> 02:52.797
What is it?

02:55.216 --> 02:56.426
It's an insect

02:57.135 --> 02:59.053
that's placed in one's bloodstream.

02:59.721 --> 03:01.055
So-i was the one.

03:02.140 --> 03:05.643
But I don't know how
it's in Seo Yul's body.

03:05.727 --> 03:07.270
Who put it in So-i's body?

03:09.355 --> 03:11.691
Jin Mu?

03:41.846 --> 03:42.805
Yul.

03:44.641 --> 03:45.642
Yul.

03:53.858 --> 03:55.902
Seo Yul was attacked by Cheonbugwan mages?

03:55.985 --> 03:56.903
I don't understand you.

03:56.986 --> 03:59.614
I just received word from Songrim.
Everyone in Daeho is scared.

03:59.697 --> 04:01.074
This must be a mistake.

04:01.157 --> 04:03.534
Why would Cheonbugwan mages
attack Seo Yul?

04:03.618 --> 04:04.661
My lord!

04:06.454 --> 04:07.455
Something's wrong.

04:07.538 --> 04:10.124
Yeom-su and our mages have been
attacked at the gambling den.

04:10.208 --> 04:11.042
What?

04:11.751 --> 04:13.544
Why would they? By who?

04:13.628 --> 04:16.256
It was Jang Uk.
He single-handedly took them all down.

04:19.342 --> 04:22.345
A dozen or so Cheonbugwan mages
attacked him while he was alone.

04:22.428 --> 04:23.680
If Jang Uk hadn't been there,

04:24.389 --> 04:25.640
Yul would have certainly died.

04:26.975 --> 04:29.185
You said Yul's been taken to Sejukwon.

04:30.812 --> 04:32.021
How is he doing right now?

04:32.105 --> 04:34.774
They're saying
Seo Yul remains in critical condition.

04:35.525 --> 04:37.735
If Seo Yul really dies because of this,

04:38.528 --> 04:41.239
Songrim and Cheonbugwan will
breakout into a clash.

04:46.494 --> 04:50.623
It's entered into Yul's core of energy.

04:51.124 --> 04:52.917
Then you have to get it out of him.

04:53.001 --> 04:57.422
No one can remove it
when it's in a mage's core of energy.

04:57.505 --> 05:00.550
It will not come out until he is dead.

05:00.633 --> 05:02.051
If his energy surged,

05:02.593 --> 05:04.595
the blood parasites would have, too.

05:05.096 --> 05:07.056
It would have caused him terrible pain.

05:07.140 --> 05:08.599
To fight in this state,

05:08.683 --> 05:11.686
one can only imagine
the pain he felt at the end.

05:13.313 --> 05:14.772
What do you mean the end?

05:16.524 --> 05:18.026
You're telling me Yul's going to die?

05:18.651 --> 05:19.610
Yul.

05:20.361 --> 05:21.821
Please find some way to save him.

05:22.864 --> 05:25.033
There's no way that
we can let him die like this.

05:25.533 --> 05:28.077
What pain my Yul must have suffered!

05:32.081 --> 05:32.915
Yul.

05:44.802 --> 05:47.764
In Seoho Fortress sits
Yul's Lantern of Life.

05:47.847 --> 05:49.140
SEO YUL

05:49.223 --> 05:52.894
If Yul were to die,
his Lantern of Life will go out.

05:53.478 --> 05:56.898
Then his father, General Seo,
would come to the capital

05:56.981 --> 05:59.233
to uncover what was the true cause

05:59.817 --> 06:02.570
of his son's unforeseen demise.

06:04.322 --> 06:06.657
The Seo family retreated
because of Master Seo Gyeong.

06:06.741 --> 06:08.284
They've been protecting
the Seoho Fortress.

06:08.368 --> 06:11.496
If they were to come here and clash
with the Cheonbugwan of the royal family,

06:12.538 --> 06:14.040
it could very well turn into war.

06:14.123 --> 06:15.166
Seo Il…

06:16.167 --> 06:17.668
is your older brother, isn't he?

06:17.752 --> 06:20.046
Reach out to him first, reason with him.

06:21.130 --> 06:24.384
Even if I'm his sister, he won't listen
to someone who switched her body with…

06:25.218 --> 06:26.511
a Choi family shaman.

06:28.262 --> 06:29.180
What you need

06:30.014 --> 06:32.100
is to worry
how Songrim will react to this.

06:40.358 --> 06:42.110
It's been a while since I've seen Uk.

06:42.610 --> 06:43.444
I believe…

06:44.237 --> 06:45.571
that he's gone to Cheonbugwan.

06:45.655 --> 06:49.325
I have no intentions
of trying to stop him from going.

06:49.409 --> 06:52.286
The Seo's heir is near death
because of their actions.

06:52.370 --> 06:55.164
Cheonbugwan has to pay
for what they've done.

06:55.998 --> 06:59.377
I will… go support Jang Uk.

06:59.460 --> 07:00.878
What will Songrim do?

07:02.672 --> 07:05.675
Uncle, I'm yet to have
the confidence to represent Songrim.

07:05.758 --> 07:07.593
But given what's happened to my friend,

07:08.469 --> 07:09.637
I'll go support him as well.

07:11.180 --> 07:13.724
Park Dang-gu. You must protect Songrim.

07:16.436 --> 07:18.896
And Master Heo, you must take care of Yul.

07:21.065 --> 07:22.275
So gather the mages.

07:23.025 --> 07:24.277
As for Cheonbugwan…

07:25.236 --> 07:26.779
I'll go there.

07:30.324 --> 07:33.119
Seo Yul's death should be my no means
connected to Cheonbugwan.

07:33.202 --> 07:35.913
We must summon the Unanimous Assembly
and plead our innocence.

07:35.997 --> 07:37.331
- Yes.
- My lord.

07:37.415 --> 07:39.250
- He's heading here now.
- Who is?

07:39.333 --> 07:41.752
Jang Uk. He's approaching
Cheonbugwan as we speak.

08:04.567 --> 08:05.610
Jang Uk then…

08:06.652 --> 08:08.279
is coming here for me.

08:10.156 --> 08:11.824
Gather all the mages we have right now.

08:11.908 --> 08:14.368
Jang Uk is not to enter Cheonbugwan!
You hear me?

08:14.452 --> 08:15.369
Yes.

08:23.169 --> 08:25.296
They're saying
Jang Uk is headed for Cheonbugwan.

08:25.379 --> 08:27.507
Songrim is preparing
to take action as well.

08:27.590 --> 08:30.009
Sire, whatever shall we do?

08:57.245 --> 08:58.079
Fire!

09:19.392 --> 09:22.061
Hold your fire!
Stand for the Crown Prince!

09:35.116 --> 09:36.617
Stop this here, Jang Uk.

09:36.701 --> 09:37.868
Please step aside.

09:37.952 --> 09:39.745
If I do, will you keep
pushing to fight them all?

09:39.829 --> 09:41.330
None of that matters.

09:41.414 --> 09:42.290
I…

09:43.416 --> 09:45.042
will go in there and kill Jin Mu.

09:45.126 --> 09:46.210
To do that,

09:46.877 --> 09:49.380
you'll first have to cut down
every mage in Cheonbugwan.

09:49.463 --> 09:50.298
And then,

09:51.215 --> 09:53.342
you'll have to face
every soldier of the royal palace.

09:54.010 --> 09:56.012
If anyone gets in my way
in order to protect him…

09:57.597 --> 09:58.889
then I have no choice.

10:01.851 --> 10:03.978
That includes you as well, Sire.
So please…

10:05.396 --> 10:07.565
go on and keep hiding
behind him as you always do.

10:09.734 --> 10:13.029
I'm not standing here trying to stop you
because I am protecting Jin Mu!

10:17.867 --> 10:21.120
I'm standing here because I don't want
to see all your hard work be wasted.

10:22.371 --> 10:23.998
I'm aware the sword in your hand…

10:24.874 --> 10:27.209
carries all of the sorrow,
hatred, and rage you feel.

10:35.217 --> 10:36.177
Then you know…

10:37.845 --> 10:39.972
exactly who this is all directed towards.

10:42.725 --> 10:44.393
And I know I'm the reason behind that.

10:46.520 --> 10:48.606
This is why I've been struggling
to face you all this time.

10:51.150 --> 10:53.569
This entire time,
haven't you buried all of your pain

10:53.653 --> 10:57.073
so you could prevent yourself from using
your sword to take revenge on the world?

11:01.369 --> 11:03.454
I stand before you now, knowing full well…

11:11.087 --> 11:12.838
that I may die by that sword…

11:14.340 --> 11:16.717
so that all of your efforts
will not have been for nothing.

11:19.053 --> 11:22.056
He's readying to attack
His Highness! Weapons ready!

11:23.140 --> 11:23.974
Hold your fire!

11:35.820 --> 11:38.489
From this moment forward,
Jang Uk will have

11:39.240 --> 11:40.866
the full support of Songrim

11:41.617 --> 11:42.910
fighting along with him.

11:43.786 --> 11:44.954
So please, Jang Uk,

11:45.538 --> 11:46.747
make sure that you…

11:48.958 --> 11:51.085
move with much thought.

12:10.020 --> 12:11.313
If you point your sword…

12:12.857 --> 12:14.775
and brandish it anywhere in my direction,

12:17.153 --> 12:18.946
then I suppose
I'll have to fight Songrim too.

12:19.905 --> 12:22.450
I'm well aware
you neither like me nor trust me.

12:22.533 --> 12:23.576
But at least…

12:25.286 --> 12:27.788
please do not fall short
of who I expect you to be.

12:27.872 --> 12:29.790
Then I will stay here
and wait for a moment.

12:32.543 --> 12:34.003
So bring Jin Mu right to me.

12:45.556 --> 12:48.017
Cheongbugwan mages may
have harmed Seo Yul, but Jang Uk

12:48.100 --> 12:50.144
also murdered all of them.

12:50.728 --> 12:54.398
If we abide by our laws, we could end this
without holding anyone accountable.

12:54.482 --> 12:55.608
So then why…

12:56.567 --> 12:58.611
must I be the one
to answer for Seo Yul's life?

12:58.694 --> 13:00.738
But you are responsible
for the blood parasite.

13:03.491 --> 13:04.909
The blood parasite?

13:04.992 --> 13:06.786
Seo Yul's dying because of that creature…

13:07.661 --> 13:09.413
now eating away at his core of energy.

13:10.623 --> 13:14.293
Before he died, Yeom-su confessed that
you were the one who gave it to him.

13:17.046 --> 13:19.465
The only reason I put
that blood parasite in someone's body

13:19.965 --> 13:21.634
is to keep them under my control.

13:22.259 --> 13:24.261
I have no idea how it came to be in…

13:25.471 --> 13:26.472
in body of Seo Yul.

13:26.555 --> 13:27.473
That doesn't matter.

13:27.556 --> 13:30.768
If your men tried to kill Seo Yul
in order to keep Cheonbugwan's secret,

13:32.102 --> 13:33.771
then the Gwanju should
take responsibility.

13:37.191 --> 13:38.859
But how did it get in?

13:40.194 --> 13:41.695
Thankfully, Seo Yul is alive.

13:42.530 --> 13:44.073
If you tell them how to save him,

13:45.366 --> 13:47.409
then they will not ask
for your life in return.

13:47.493 --> 13:48.577
I don't know how.

13:48.661 --> 13:51.497
Jin U-tak was the one
who retrieved it from Jinyowon.

13:52.706 --> 13:54.416
I don't even know how to control it,

13:54.500 --> 13:57.169
let alone remove it
from the core of his energy.

13:57.253 --> 13:59.046
You must find a way to save him.

14:00.339 --> 14:01.215
And if you don't…

14:03.175 --> 14:05.052
Jang Uk will never back down from this.

14:24.780 --> 14:27.157
Will you stay here waiting
until Jin Mu comes out?

14:27.241 --> 14:29.451
I'm waiting to give it
much thought before I act.

14:30.494 --> 14:33.581
And then… what I'm truly aiming for
will stand before me.

14:33.664 --> 14:37.209
Then are you not aiming
for… Jin Mu's life then?

14:40.713 --> 14:42.089
Please go and stay at Yul's side.

14:43.007 --> 14:46.677
I will find a way to save his life,
no matter what it may be.

14:57.271 --> 15:00.107
Putting the heir
of the Seo family in danger?

15:00.190 --> 15:04.194
You must take full responsibility
for this, Gwanju Jin Mu.

15:04.278 --> 15:08.657
If Seoho Fortress were to mobilize,
Daeho Fortress could find itself at war.

15:08.741 --> 15:09.783
What are you going to do?

15:09.867 --> 15:11.577
Look at this mess that you have made!

15:14.997 --> 15:17.291
That's why I asked you all
here today, mages…

15:18.626 --> 15:21.170
so we could try to prevent
a war from breaking out.

15:21.253 --> 15:23.255
How would we know
how to remove a blood parasite?

15:23.756 --> 15:25.341
Who here has even seen one before?

15:25.424 --> 15:29.470
If Seo Yul dies,
Jang Uk will, for sure, kill you.

15:29.970 --> 15:33.349
Go to him and beg for his forgiveness,
offer your own life.

15:33.432 --> 15:35.684
Then at least we can prevent
a war from breaking out.

15:35.768 --> 15:38.103
He's right! Go beg!
We cannot have a war here!

15:38.187 --> 15:40.147
- Take responsibility!
- Please, everyone, calm down.

15:41.231 --> 15:42.358
I must ask…

15:43.609 --> 15:44.693
that you help me.

15:50.032 --> 15:51.992
If it is from Jinyowon,

15:52.493 --> 15:54.912
that means Lady Jin may know how.

15:54.995 --> 15:58.040
But last I heard she carries
a deep grudge against Gwanju Jin Mu.

15:58.123 --> 15:59.249
I doubt she'll help him.

15:59.333 --> 16:00.542
Then he'll have to beg.

16:00.626 --> 16:02.711
Jinyowon is our only hope to stop this.

16:10.135 --> 16:10.970
Ho-gyeong.

16:11.553 --> 16:13.597
Please, I beg you
to help save your brother.

16:13.681 --> 16:17.059
I have come to you on my knees
asking for your mercy once again.

16:17.142 --> 16:20.020
The Gwanju of Cheonbugwan begging
is quite the sight.

16:20.896 --> 16:23.649
It seems that
you really fear Jang Uk after all.

16:26.527 --> 16:28.821
The blood parasite came
from Jinyowon.

16:28.904 --> 16:30.614
So Jinyowon also bears the responsibility.

16:30.698 --> 16:33.659
You and U-tak are responsible.
This has nothing to do with me.

16:34.493 --> 16:35.619
Lady Jin.

16:36.578 --> 16:38.247
If Seo Yul dies like this,

16:38.330 --> 16:41.000
you'll have to bear the wrath as well.

16:41.083 --> 16:42.126
I'm not afraid of that.

16:45.212 --> 16:47.423
If Seo Yul dies and I die with him,

16:48.549 --> 16:50.009
do you really think
that it would end there?

16:50.843 --> 16:53.095
You and I both belong to the Jin family.

16:53.178 --> 16:54.138
We're both guilty.

16:55.264 --> 16:57.391
So Jinyowon will die with me.

17:01.979 --> 17:04.648
Lady Jin, I command you
to find a way to save Seo Yul

17:04.732 --> 17:06.400
and make Jang Uk leave.

17:07.484 --> 17:09.820
It's maddening knowing that he's there.

17:11.238 --> 17:13.449
I feel like I'm gonna suffocate in here.

17:15.409 --> 17:18.370
Whether it's by sacrificing yourselves
or offering some plan,

17:18.454 --> 17:19.788
find a way to settle.

17:32.718 --> 17:33.677
As I promised…

17:35.054 --> 17:36.055
Jin Mu has arrived.

17:48.358 --> 17:50.569
I believe that there was an error.

17:51.153 --> 17:54.823
Therefore, as the Gwanju of Cheonbugwan,
I would like to fully apologize for…

17:55.949 --> 17:58.202
endangering the Seo's heir.

17:59.912 --> 18:01.205
No.

18:01.288 --> 18:03.540
You should apologize to Yul,
and not to me.

18:04.833 --> 18:05.667
After you cure him.

18:08.087 --> 18:09.129
Well, yes, of course.

18:09.213 --> 18:12.591
That is exactly the reason
why I found a way to save him.

18:12.674 --> 18:14.510
Ho-gyeong.

18:25.020 --> 18:27.648
I persuaded Lady Jin,
and together, we found a way.

18:35.030 --> 18:35.864
So then…

18:37.407 --> 18:38.534
we're here once again.

18:39.118 --> 18:40.744
So you managed to drag me here

18:41.662 --> 18:43.122
by causing such a scene.

18:44.665 --> 18:45.582
This is why…

18:47.126 --> 18:50.129
you should have told me before
while I was still asking you politely.

18:54.216 --> 18:55.884
So-i wasn't captured and brought here.

18:56.844 --> 18:58.929
She came here with the intention
of saving Yul, didn't she?

19:00.430 --> 19:04.393
So the one she risked
her own life to save was Seo Yul.

19:04.476 --> 19:05.769
But I'm sure you know a way.

19:06.395 --> 19:08.438
You know how to remove
the parasite in his body.

19:09.648 --> 19:10.983
Yul is dying as we speak.

19:13.235 --> 19:15.612
Please help him. I beg of you, Lady Jin.

19:18.115 --> 19:21.618
I'm not interested
in whether Seo Yul lives or dies.

19:27.457 --> 19:28.292
I am sorry.

19:40.053 --> 19:41.805
You said that you weren't interested,

19:42.389 --> 19:44.141
so I thought I would grab your attention.

19:44.725 --> 19:45.559
It seems…

19:46.143 --> 19:47.477
you came to me in the end.

19:48.395 --> 19:50.189
I didn't even have to take a step.

19:55.903 --> 19:57.863
So you didn't come here
with the intent to slay me.

19:57.946 --> 20:01.575
You were only using me so that
you can force Lady Jin's hand.

20:01.658 --> 20:04.828
With Yul's life at stake, the only thing
I'm focused on is saving him.

20:05.495 --> 20:07.748
I couldn't care less
about ending your worthless life.

20:09.249 --> 20:10.083
Worthless?

20:16.590 --> 20:19.760
If you knew this beforehand,
you should have told me sooner.

20:20.594 --> 20:25.349
Then I wouldn't have had to humiliate
myself by offering an apology to him.

20:26.058 --> 20:30.854
Why should I be the only one to get
humiliated being forced to come here?

20:32.981 --> 20:34.107
So you can leave now.

20:34.191 --> 20:37.736
Come to Jinyowon,
and I'll tell you how to save him.

20:53.669 --> 20:56.380
For three years, you've been obedient
and never made a move.

20:56.463 --> 21:00.133
And yet simply by coming here,
you managed to create a state of panic.

21:00.717 --> 21:02.719
Cheonbugwan, Songrim, Jinyowon,

21:02.803 --> 21:06.348
the Unanimous Assembly,
the royal family and even Seoho.

21:08.016 --> 21:09.393
You are incredible.

21:11.979 --> 21:12.813
And yet…

21:15.649 --> 21:17.276
I stopped like you asked me to.

21:24.032 --> 21:25.158
Gwanju Jin Mu.

21:26.618 --> 21:29.246
I hope you go to
the constellation basin in Cheonbugwan

21:29.746 --> 21:31.915
and pray to the stars
that Yul will survive this.

21:33.375 --> 21:35.127
Because if Yul doesn't survive,
then you will…

21:37.129 --> 21:38.297
surely die.

22:06.825 --> 22:09.953
I'm sorry. I should have
immediately told the others…

22:11.747 --> 22:13.040
when I saw something in you.

22:22.799 --> 22:24.468
All I'm able to do is see.

22:28.805 --> 22:30.015
I can't do anything else.

22:33.852 --> 22:35.729
You can have three breaths.

22:35.812 --> 22:38.899
All my memories
of Danhyanggok are wonderful.

22:45.197 --> 22:47.074
You can't just
touch him however you please!

22:50.702 --> 22:53.080
Don't you know
just how critical his condition is?

22:57.250 --> 22:58.543
I heard you knew along,

22:59.669 --> 23:00.837
but you kept it to yourself.

23:05.550 --> 23:06.885
You're interfering. Please go.

23:13.892 --> 23:15.268
What was that just then?

23:27.406 --> 23:28.698
What are these?

23:29.199 --> 23:31.868
I have no clue what medicine
Young Master Seo had been taking.

23:32.494 --> 23:34.746
He had everything packed up,
so I brought them all for you.

23:36.123 --> 23:37.707
Are you looking for his medicine?

23:37.791 --> 23:38.625
Yeah.

23:50.887 --> 23:51.805
What's that there?

23:53.348 --> 23:55.308
It appears to be
a letter sealed with energy.

23:56.101 --> 23:58.353
I told you not to touch things
however you please!

24:01.731 --> 24:03.984
I only wanted to see
which medicine he's been taking.

24:04.067 --> 24:05.444
I know how to do that myself.

24:06.278 --> 24:07.112
Please go now.

24:15.745 --> 24:17.873
You think Young Master Seo
sealed it himself?

24:18.957 --> 24:20.083
I think he did.

24:24.045 --> 24:27.048
I asked him to go with me to Danhyanggok
while he was in such pain.

24:30.677 --> 24:33.430
But wait, was that
really a memory just then?

24:34.139 --> 24:36.725
It's not possible that
we've gone to Danhyanggok together.

24:37.350 --> 24:39.436
Young Lady Jin.

24:39.519 --> 24:41.855
They say they found a way.
Yul can still be saved!

24:41.938 --> 24:42.772
Is that really true?

24:42.856 --> 24:45.692
Lady Jin says there's a way to remove
the blood parasite from his body.

24:46.485 --> 24:49.070
My uncle and Uk have gone over
to Jinyowon to find out.

24:50.489 --> 24:53.742
My mother agreed to tell Uk
how to remove the blood parasite?

24:53.825 --> 24:57.412
Yeah, if Lady Jin offers her help,
I know Yul will make it.

24:57.496 --> 24:59.414
Uk will do anything for him.

24:59.498 --> 25:01.541
I know he'll save Yul, whatever the cost.

25:03.084 --> 25:03.919
I know he will.

25:07.589 --> 25:08.632
Whatever it takes…

25:09.799 --> 25:10.634
he'll do it.

25:11.885 --> 25:13.553
The blood parasite is an insect.

25:14.095 --> 25:17.140
And birds are the perfect creature
to get rid of them.

25:17.224 --> 25:20.393
Jinyowon is home
to the most formidable bird.

25:22.187 --> 25:23.021
The fire bird.

25:26.107 --> 25:27.776
How can the fire bird be the answer?

25:29.027 --> 25:30.111
It's way too dangerous.

25:30.195 --> 25:33.156
It is dangerous,
but it's not impossible to use it.

25:35.408 --> 25:36.743
We have Jang Uk, right?

25:39.996 --> 25:43.041
I'll do whatever it takes,
just tell me how to save Yul.

25:43.124 --> 25:44.751
If that's the case, let me ask you.

25:45.293 --> 25:48.004
We both know
you require my help to do this.

25:48.088 --> 25:51.299
If I agree to help,
will you do anything I ask of you?

25:54.010 --> 25:55.929
Send my daughter Bu-yeon back to me.

25:56.513 --> 25:58.348
Then I promise I will help you.

25:59.724 --> 26:00.892
But refuse me…

26:01.935 --> 26:05.230
I won't do a single thing to help you.

26:05.313 --> 26:08.900
Even if you found out how,
you wouldn't be able to…

26:10.443 --> 26:11.570
save your dear friend.

26:12.195 --> 26:13.029
Fine, I agree.

26:14.114 --> 26:15.448
I will do as you like, Lady Jin.

26:16.992 --> 26:17.909
So help us, please!

26:21.246 --> 26:22.163
And Bu-yeon…

26:25.917 --> 26:26.918
I'll send her back to you.

26:29.170 --> 26:30.088
I appreciate it.

26:32.757 --> 26:35.844
Since you're here to witness this,
Jang Uk will keep his word.

26:35.927 --> 26:39.973
You can trust that
Jinyowon will help save Seo Yul.

26:42.100 --> 26:44.436
Thank you for… helping us.

26:51.151 --> 26:51.985
The fire bird?

26:52.527 --> 26:55.447
It will be very dangerous,
but we should try.

26:55.530 --> 26:58.366
Dang-gu, go bring Jin Cho-yeon here.

26:58.992 --> 27:00.744
We will need blood from the Jin family.

27:00.827 --> 27:03.246
- Yes, of course, I'll get her right away.
- Uh.

27:03.872 --> 27:05.832
And you should go over to Seoho Fortress.

27:05.915 --> 27:08.710
If Yul's father hears any strange rumors,

27:08.793 --> 27:10.211
we may expect trouble.

27:10.295 --> 27:13.340
You can explain it all.
Tell him it will be fine.

27:13.423 --> 27:15.467
I'll tell him
that we'll do everything we can.

27:16.092 --> 27:17.302
So please save Yul.

27:18.720 --> 27:20.764
Uk, your role is the most important.

27:20.847 --> 27:22.307
You must enter Jinyowon.

27:22.807 --> 27:26.353
You won't go alone.
Someone that will help is waiting for you.

27:26.853 --> 27:28.897
- Don't pick a fight with him.
- Him? Who?

27:30.148 --> 27:31.191
Who is there?

27:37.238 --> 27:40.742
I will be the one who enters
Jinyowon alongside Jang Uk.

27:40.825 --> 27:43.995
If you two start bickering in there
and wake the fire bird,

27:45.580 --> 27:47.874
the world will go up in flames.

27:50.418 --> 27:53.088
This will be dangerous.
This is why you should make sure

27:53.171 --> 27:57.092
Jang Uk knows he'll have no choice
but to do what I tell him, Lady Jin.

27:58.218 --> 28:00.553
Be serious! Do you really think
the prince will listen to me?

28:00.637 --> 28:02.347
He'll just do what he pleases, saying that

28:02.430 --> 28:04.265
"But I'm the prince."
It'd be better if he wasn't there.

28:04.349 --> 28:06.685
Apparently, the Crown Prince went to
Master Heo himself

28:06.768 --> 28:08.728
and offered his services to help save Yul.

28:09.354 --> 28:11.189
All cause of that turtle?

28:12.732 --> 28:13.650
What do you mean?

28:13.733 --> 28:17.028
Right now, I feel as though
the Crown Prince is slowly crawling

28:17.112 --> 28:18.905
closer towards me as if
he was some kind of turtle.

28:18.988 --> 28:22.283
Or maybe, what's really happening
is that you are slowly letting him in.

28:24.160 --> 28:25.286
But wait, Uk…

28:27.330 --> 28:29.582
are you really going to be all right
without her at your side?

28:34.671 --> 28:36.464
I wasn't expecting Lady Jin…

28:37.465 --> 28:39.968
to ask us for something like that
in return for her help.

28:40.677 --> 28:41.803
But if you send her back,

28:42.429 --> 28:46.099
you won't be able to kill yourself
by removing the stone.

28:46.182 --> 28:48.560
Just like the time when
you cooked those awful noodles for me,

28:49.185 --> 28:50.854
someone else came and comforted me too.

28:51.813 --> 28:53.106
They reminded me that

28:53.189 --> 28:55.900
"If you're not going to do anything,
you may as well just die."

28:56.568 --> 28:57.444
It was just…

28:57.986 --> 29:00.697
her way of encouraging me
to do everything while I'm still alive.

29:03.408 --> 29:06.369
Uk, who would you save first
if we were drowning?

29:06.453 --> 29:07.454
Maidservant Kim or me?

29:07.537 --> 29:08.455
Maidservant Kim.

29:08.538 --> 29:10.123
You should save both of us.

29:10.206 --> 29:14.669
Yul and Bu-yeon are both
drowning right now, you fool.

29:14.753 --> 29:16.004
And now you're thinking

29:16.087 --> 29:18.256
Yul is in grave danger
so you'll just give up on her?

29:18.798 --> 29:20.341
But since he is in danger,

29:20.842 --> 29:23.219
I don't have the luxury of deciding
who I have to give up on.

29:25.221 --> 29:26.264
That's not how to do it.

29:29.225 --> 29:30.977
If someone is so dear to you,

29:32.061 --> 29:35.565
don't ever think of
letting them go and abandoning them.

29:43.740 --> 29:46.117
I've been feeling so guilty
for keeping her by my side.

29:48.536 --> 29:49.370
But I know…

29:51.831 --> 29:52.957
this will be for the better.

30:11.726 --> 30:14.270
- I heard that you went to Jinyowon.
- Yeah.

30:14.354 --> 30:17.315
Did my mother tell you
how you should save Yul then?

30:19.400 --> 30:20.235
Mm-hmm.

30:20.318 --> 30:21.486
That's a relief.

30:23.947 --> 30:25.031
I'm happy to help too.

30:25.698 --> 30:27.158
You never know if I'll be of use to you.

30:27.742 --> 30:30.995
You have done everything
that you can to help us already.

30:33.915 --> 30:34.749
But still…

30:36.876 --> 30:39.963
it's better off that
I'm helpful until the end, right?

30:47.595 --> 30:48.930
Don't worry about that.

30:51.099 --> 30:51.933
Stay here.

30:52.767 --> 30:53.977
I'll explain everything…

30:55.061 --> 30:56.020
once it's all over.

31:04.696 --> 31:06.114
I'm not offering to help you out.

31:06.906 --> 31:08.324
Yul is my friend too.

31:08.908 --> 31:10.118
And I'm in his debt.

31:12.287 --> 31:13.121
I want to help.

31:19.794 --> 31:20.628
Fine.

31:21.838 --> 31:22.672
Go ahead.

31:24.299 --> 31:25.133
Let's go.

31:36.394 --> 31:38.897
So then,
he's chosen to let me go.

31:45.486 --> 31:50.074
I'll begin with a brief explanation of
this complex parasite removal operation

31:50.158 --> 31:51.659
that Master Heo's prepared for Yul.

31:53.328 --> 31:55.455
Right now, at the core of his energy,

31:55.538 --> 31:58.082
there is a blood parasite
that's straining his life force.

31:58.666 --> 32:00.960
The only way he can live is
if his energy remains

32:01.044 --> 32:02.003
when the parasite's removed.

32:02.587 --> 32:06.007
And the only thing
capable of doing so is the fire bird.

32:06.090 --> 32:08.801
What we must do is chase out

32:08.885 --> 32:12.722
the blood parasite
with the fire bird that's inside Jinyowon

32:12.805 --> 32:15.600
and make it expel
the energy it's consumed.

32:15.683 --> 32:19.062
However, there are two complications. Hmm!

32:20.647 --> 32:23.566
The first problem we have is that
we can't transport him to Jinyowon

32:23.650 --> 32:25.401
in the state that he's currently in.

32:25.985 --> 32:28.571
And also, the fire bird can't
be removed either.

32:29.697 --> 32:33.117
Our second problem is breaking
the fire bird's barrier is too dangerous.

32:33.201 --> 32:35.912
So we must use its energy
without breaking its barrier.

32:35.995 --> 32:38.581
The first problem is not possible.

32:38.665 --> 32:41.542
We can't move Yul or the fire bird.

32:41.626 --> 32:43.920
So how can we use
the fire bird to do that?

32:44.003 --> 32:46.839
That's why we called you here, Cho-yeon.

32:46.923 --> 32:51.427
You must open the gate
and enter Jinyowon in place of Yul's body.

32:52.345 --> 32:53.346
What? Me?

32:54.472 --> 32:59.686
This is the water wick
used in Seo family's Lanterns of Life.

33:00.269 --> 33:04.983
Members of the Seo family
always fill these wicks with their energy

33:05.066 --> 33:07.735
in order to connect
to their Lanterns of Life. 

33:07.819 --> 33:10.113
This has been
their practice for centuries.

33:10.196 --> 33:11.030
SEO YUL

33:11.114 --> 33:15.118
I will fill this
with what still remains within Yul.

33:15.201 --> 33:17.704
Then the blood parasite will think

33:17.787 --> 33:21.124
this is really his core of energy
and enter this instead.

33:22.041 --> 33:24.335
Then we can just remove
the parasite with this!

33:24.419 --> 33:27.839
Did you hear me when I say that it has to
expel everything it has consumed?

33:27.922 --> 33:28.923
But why…

33:29.590 --> 33:32.051
must I be the one
who takes it to Jinyowon?

33:32.135 --> 33:35.013
That's because the blood parasite was made

33:35.096 --> 33:36.973
with some of your family's own blood.

33:38.182 --> 33:39.017
What?

33:39.100 --> 33:41.019
Why do you think
that Jin Mu put it in So-i?

33:41.769 --> 33:44.313
He put your family's energy
in that parasite

33:44.397 --> 33:47.025
and put it in her
so she could open Jinyowon.

33:49.193 --> 33:52.613
So then the blood parasite was
made with Cho-yeon's blood.

33:52.697 --> 33:57.493
Once that parasite mistakes this
for the real thing and enters into it,

33:57.577 --> 34:01.914
I will put this into Cho-yeon's body
which has the same energy

34:01.998 --> 34:04.375
as the blood parasite.

34:05.001 --> 34:07.086
- Isn't that gonna be dangerous though?
- Ah!

34:07.170 --> 34:09.797
Just place this in your mouth
and do not open it.

34:11.799 --> 34:12.633
Right.

34:13.301 --> 34:14.343
I will carry it then.

34:14.427 --> 34:17.388
Good! Even someone who can't
wield magic can do this.

34:17.930 --> 34:21.434
It will be fine if you don't have
any parasites or are expecting.

34:22.143 --> 34:23.519
What?

34:23.603 --> 34:24.687
Oh! Oh, hold on!

34:26.397 --> 34:28.024
Uh, do you…

34:28.983 --> 34:31.903
Young Lady Jin, remember that one night?

34:33.196 --> 34:36.449
You know, that day when we went to
the house that was supposed to be ours.

34:37.325 --> 34:38.159
Maybe…

34:45.249 --> 34:48.002
She can't! She, uh…
she's not able to do it.

34:48.086 --> 34:49.629
Not if there's even
the slightest possibility

34:49.712 --> 34:50.755
that she's pregnant.

34:50.838 --> 34:51.798
You little…

34:55.468 --> 34:57.970
So then, do we need
to ask Lady Jin to do it?

34:58.888 --> 35:02.016
She must stay outside Jinyowon's door
to ensure the other relics

35:02.100 --> 35:03.226
don't end up turning on us.

35:03.309 --> 35:04.143
Then…

35:05.353 --> 35:06.479
I'm willing to do it myself.

35:07.146 --> 35:12.151
But you two are already married.
Are… Are you sure? Will it be all right?

35:12.735 --> 35:13.653
Don't worry about that.

35:14.362 --> 35:16.322
That's not possible at all.

35:18.157 --> 35:19.283
- Not at all?
- Yeah.

35:19.784 --> 35:21.536
Not even the slightest chance
of that happening.

35:25.039 --> 35:25.915
Yeah, she's right.

35:28.793 --> 35:30.586
- I'm telling you it's true.
- Hmm!

35:31.796 --> 35:36.717
I guess Bu-yeon can be the one
to carry, uh, Yul's energy over there.

35:38.511 --> 35:39.846
So now,

35:39.929 --> 35:41.430
we just have the second problem left.

35:42.181 --> 35:45.226
How can we extract the fire bird's energy
without breaking the barrier?

35:45.309 --> 35:49.397
The barrier of the fire bird
is made of an energy 

35:49.480 --> 35:52.233
that's similar to the volcano
where it was born.

35:52.316 --> 35:56.654
It's made of an energy
from gold that's 30,000 nyang.

35:56.737 --> 36:00.950
We must use gold to recreate it
and expand the barrier,

36:01.033 --> 36:02.535
to go inside it.

36:02.618 --> 36:05.913
Whoa, so we need
the energy of 30,000 nyang in gold?

36:05.997 --> 36:09.125
Where could we possibly get
30,000 nyang of gold at this hour?

36:09.750 --> 36:13.629
Sang-ho is gathering it now.
I know we're in a rush,

36:13.713 --> 36:17.133
but it will take some time
to gather 30,000 nyang in gold.

36:17.216 --> 36:18.634
I have 30,000 nyang.

36:18.718 --> 36:20.469
I mean, I also have that much money.

36:20.553 --> 36:23.097
But the only problem is that
I can't get it in gold right now.

36:23.181 --> 36:24.432
No, I'm saying I have the gold now.

36:27.143 --> 36:28.186
It's at Jeongjingak.

36:28.269 --> 36:29.270
What?

36:30.897 --> 36:31.981
Here?

36:32.064 --> 36:32.899
Yeah.

36:34.108 --> 36:34.942
Hmm.

36:47.663 --> 36:50.708
Every time the Crown Prince rewarded me,
I stashed it in here.

36:51.375 --> 36:52.210
Wow!

36:52.293 --> 36:55.129
So you just left all of it here like this?

36:55.213 --> 36:57.840
Well, I have no need for it
and didn't want to drag it home.

36:58.507 --> 37:02.386
I get 1,000 nyang for each soul shifter,
so there should be 30,000 nyang.

37:02.470 --> 37:03.554
Excellent!

37:03.638 --> 37:06.432
Then we are ready to remove that parasite.

37:06.515 --> 37:07.350
Let's start.

37:08.017 --> 37:10.603
Dang-gu and Cho-yeon,
move the gold we need to Jinyowon.

37:11.229 --> 37:14.649
And I'll follow you
once we get Yul's energy into her.

37:17.193 --> 37:18.027
Hmm.

37:39.257 --> 37:43.594
And now, the energy
in him will no longer surge.

37:44.095 --> 37:46.389
And all the energy in his core…

37:47.598 --> 37:50.518
will be sent
to the water wick of his Lantern.

37:58.401 --> 38:01.779
I can see the blood parasite
leaving his core of energy.

38:03.614 --> 38:04.740
Okay now.

38:19.922 --> 38:21.424
Open your mouth.

38:31.017 --> 38:31.851
This here

38:32.643 --> 38:35.438
is the same as what remains of Yul's life.

38:36.480 --> 38:37.440
You must not swallow it,

38:38.399 --> 38:40.735
or even open your mouth before then.

38:46.198 --> 38:49.076
Yul can only hold on for this much time.

38:49.160 --> 38:50.453
You must return

38:51.037 --> 38:53.873
only with his torrent of energy
before time's up.

38:54.749 --> 38:57.001
Uk, I trust you with this.

38:57.084 --> 38:58.377
Yes, I'll make sure…

38:59.503 --> 39:00.713
we're back before time runs out.

39:02.506 --> 39:03.341
Let's go.

39:12.725 --> 39:16.604
So this pile of gold is from
all those times I rewarded Jang Uk?

39:17.646 --> 39:19.815
He never used a single one,
just piled them here.

39:19.899 --> 39:22.193
He'll live thanks to Jang Uk.

39:23.235 --> 39:26.238
We must protect Jinyowon's door
with my mother.

39:27.615 --> 39:29.033
You can wait here, Your Highness…

39:30.368 --> 39:32.870
since Jang Uk and my sister
will be here soon.

39:34.080 --> 39:35.247
Jin Bu-yeon will be here too?

39:35.956 --> 39:38.376
Yes. Please don't start arguing with Uk.

39:38.459 --> 39:39.293
We won't argue.

39:40.086 --> 39:42.630
Jang Uk and I share a turtle together.

39:45.925 --> 39:47.426
Have you seen how smart that thing is?

39:53.349 --> 39:54.809
Bu-yeon, why did you come here as well?

39:54.892 --> 39:56.519
How did you get involved in this?

39:57.186 --> 39:58.396
Haven't you told her yet?

40:00.940 --> 40:04.568
Right now, she can't speak
as she has Seo Yul's energy in her mouth.

40:08.406 --> 40:11.033
When you enter into Jinyowon,
the Prince will be waiting for you there.

40:11.117 --> 40:12.243
Go on ahead.

40:22.753 --> 40:24.505
If you don't keep the promise you made me,

40:24.588 --> 40:27.007
then I will refuse to save him.

40:27.091 --> 40:29.969
I promise I'll keep my end of the bargain
and send her home, so you…

40:32.304 --> 40:33.264
can rest assured.

40:54.785 --> 40:56.996
Turtle Shaman? What are you doing here?

40:57.621 --> 40:58.998
Are you working at Jinyowon now?

41:04.545 --> 41:05.421
Uh…

41:05.504 --> 41:09.467
Currently, I'm doing my job,
you know, with the Prince.

41:09.550 --> 41:11.260
I, uh, with His Highness.

41:13.554 --> 41:14.847
Thanks for waiting, Your Highness.

41:21.687 --> 41:22.563
Yeah, right.

41:23.147 --> 41:24.857
Yes, that's me.

41:25.441 --> 41:27.735
It's been me, the Prince, all along.

41:32.448 --> 41:33.282
But wait!

41:34.533 --> 41:35.993
Then are you Jin Bu-yeon?

41:37.495 --> 41:39.788
Yeah, this is Jin Bu-yeon, Your Highness.

41:39.872 --> 41:43.501
Hold on! She's not a shaman,
but the Jinyowon priestess, Jin Bu-yeon?

41:43.584 --> 41:45.127
You know who she is?

41:45.836 --> 41:46.837
You know him?

41:47.463 --> 41:48.964
Then your husband is…

41:55.513 --> 41:56.514
What's wrong?

42:03.812 --> 42:06.148
The turtle? Oh, the eunuch.

42:08.943 --> 42:09.985
That was him?

42:10.778 --> 42:12.029
The Crown Prince, I mean,

42:12.696 --> 42:14.365
His Royal Highness was the eunuch?

42:20.788 --> 42:22.081
I get why now…

42:23.374 --> 42:26.710
you'd take care of my turtle
like that, Jang Uk.

42:28.504 --> 42:29.380
Jeez!

42:39.807 --> 42:42.101
His Royal Highness said
you would be only safe

42:42.184 --> 42:45.521
if Seo Yul survives this ordeal,
and want to help them save him.

42:48.148 --> 42:50.818
Let us hope that
His Royal Highness is not just using this

42:50.901 --> 42:52.611
as an excuse to kill me.

42:54.113 --> 42:56.490
Did you say he rescued
this turtle and brought it here?

42:56.574 --> 42:59.118
Yes, His Highness saved
that turtle from getting killed himself.

42:59.201 --> 43:02.621
Why would he bother
raising something so weak and useless?

43:07.418 --> 43:09.086
First, I'll summon
the energy of the gold

43:09.169 --> 43:11.755
and use it to expand the barrier
surrounding the fire bird's egg.

43:11.839 --> 43:13.048
Then all you have to do

43:13.132 --> 43:16.135
is capture the parasite
shocked by the fire bird's energy.

43:16.218 --> 43:18.012
And after that,
it will come out of her body?

43:18.596 --> 43:19.430
Understood.

43:20.014 --> 43:21.473
Shaman, come in now.

43:32.318 --> 43:34.653
So Jang Uk was the one troubling you?

43:34.737 --> 43:37.197
You must have suffered
far greater than I thought.

43:38.240 --> 43:40.326
Ah, did you find your own room?

43:41.452 --> 43:43.579
You should have listened to me
and come to my house.

43:44.371 --> 43:45.289
I live in the palace.

43:45.998 --> 43:48.042
It's not like
I have plenty of rooms, right?

43:52.630 --> 43:54.548
What's wrong? Surge the energy.

44:27.665 --> 44:30.584
The blood parasite's emerged.
It's moving through her bloodstream.

44:30.668 --> 44:33.545
You must wait until it expels
all of Yul's torrent of energy.

44:34.088 --> 44:35.506
Hang in there. You got this, Bu-yeon.

44:49.937 --> 44:51.605
His torrent of energy has returned.

44:52.189 --> 44:53.899
All that's left is to remove the parasite.

44:53.982 --> 44:54.817
Where did it go?

45:24.513 --> 45:25.514
Hang in there.

45:31.854 --> 45:32.855
Are you okay?

45:33.981 --> 45:34.940
It must really hurt.

45:40.904 --> 45:41.864
Let's see how he's doing.

45:42.740 --> 45:43.574
Let's go.

45:59.381 --> 46:00.215
Now me.

46:00.299 --> 46:03.635
The gold barrier must not be broken.
So be careful on your way out of there.

46:04.470 --> 46:05.846
Let's hurry. Time's almost up.

46:08.891 --> 46:09.850
Me too!

46:18.317 --> 46:19.276
Hey!

46:29.244 --> 46:31.789
Time! It's almost up!

46:31.872 --> 46:33.081
Quick! Quick! Get it in his mouth.

46:33.165 --> 46:34.666
Now! Now! Let's go!

46:36.210 --> 46:37.044
Go!

47:06.865 --> 47:10.744
Oh! He's safe! He's safe!

47:13.163 --> 47:15.040
We did it! We really did it!

47:15.791 --> 47:18.335
Seo Yul is alive!

47:18.418 --> 47:21.839
Oh, Yul! I… I can feel his pulse again.

47:21.922 --> 47:22.965
I can't believe it!

47:24.174 --> 47:25.300
We did it!

47:25.384 --> 47:26.718
- My goodness.
- Seo Yul's alive then.

47:26.802 --> 47:27.678
- Yeah.
- Oh, Yul!

47:27.761 --> 47:29.346
- My goodness, we did it! Well done.
- You did good, Jang Uk.

47:31.682 --> 47:32.724
You did too…

47:33.809 --> 47:34.893
Your Royal Highness.

47:41.358 --> 47:42.317
I still…

47:42.943 --> 47:45.195
can't believe you were the husband
that was troubling her.

47:46.822 --> 47:50.158
I'd like to know why did
Bu-yeon mistake you for a eunuch?

47:52.327 --> 47:53.704
Well, we saved the turtle together.

47:54.788 --> 47:58.917
Next time, I'll invite her
to the palace so she can visit the turtle.

48:02.254 --> 48:03.255
And if you'd like…

48:05.549 --> 48:06.758
you're welcome to join her.

48:12.264 --> 48:13.307
The turtle?

48:29.990 --> 48:30.908
Job well done.

48:33.035 --> 48:34.077
Thank you.

48:40.876 --> 48:42.920
This was among
Young Master Seo's belongings.

48:43.003 --> 48:46.548
I meant to give this before
Lord Park left for Seoho Fortress.

48:46.632 --> 48:48.634
Lord Park's already gone.
He left earlier this morning.

48:48.717 --> 48:49.593
Ah.

48:50.177 --> 48:51.303
I guess I'm too late.

48:51.887 --> 48:53.263
I'll put it back with his things.

48:58.435 --> 49:00.604
The cut the parasite came out of
might fester.

49:01.480 --> 49:04.942
Make sure to apply ointment
and take your medicine on time.

49:05.442 --> 49:06.276
Fine.

49:06.818 --> 49:08.070
I'll be fine staying here too.

49:11.114 --> 49:12.366
I'm not as dense as you think.

49:13.033 --> 49:14.660
I expected my mother to demand that

49:15.285 --> 49:17.245
in return for her helping you save him.

49:19.539 --> 49:20.958
She wants you to go back home.

49:22.501 --> 49:23.460
And I agreed to it.

49:23.543 --> 49:24.878
You think you're sending me back?

49:26.338 --> 49:28.465
I'm leaving you on my own will.

49:30.509 --> 49:32.219
My mother gave me her word too.

49:33.136 --> 49:36.223
She promised
it wouldn't be like it was before.

49:37.599 --> 49:39.393
I have nothing to lose even if I go.

49:41.228 --> 49:43.563
- But I feel bad leaving you.
- Meaning?

49:44.648 --> 49:46.483
Because I promised
to help you sleep, you know.

49:47.067 --> 49:48.276
Isn't this why you brought me here?

49:48.360 --> 49:49.987
But I'm leaving
without being able to help.

49:50.570 --> 49:51.697
You're misunderstanding me.

49:53.115 --> 49:54.491
That's not the reason
why I brought you here.

49:55.534 --> 49:56.368
Then…

49:57.786 --> 49:59.371
why did you really bring me here?

50:01.289 --> 50:02.541
It doesn't matter anymore.

50:03.250 --> 50:04.960
And I won't need
your help with that again.

50:05.043 --> 50:06.837
I also don't have anything to lose.

50:07.963 --> 50:09.297
So don't feel sorry because you're going.

50:09.381 --> 50:11.717
Even a brazier in the summer would be
missed if it goes out.

50:12.342 --> 50:14.136
Can't you say you'll miss me
even if it isn't true?

50:15.971 --> 50:17.431
A brazier during the summer is…

50:18.974 --> 50:20.267
pretty useless to begin with.

50:21.643 --> 50:22.477
Who knows?

50:23.270 --> 50:24.229
Maybe someday…

50:26.523 --> 50:27.691
I'll miss you when it gets chilly.

50:31.737 --> 50:32.571
Fine then.

50:33.196 --> 50:36.616
Your useless brazier is leaving as nothing
more than ashes after burning out.

50:37.409 --> 50:39.286
I'll disperse into the wind, and you…

50:43.582 --> 50:45.083
can freeze to death all alone.

51:06.897 --> 51:10.650
His energy is surging again
within his core.

51:10.734 --> 51:14.488
The fire bird has driven out
the parasite completely .

51:14.571 --> 51:17.699
Jang Uk and the Crown Prince
saw it with their own eyes then?

51:17.783 --> 51:18.658
Yes.

51:18.742 --> 51:22.704
They, somehow, stopped
their bickering and kept it under control

51:22.788 --> 51:24.414
so they could save Yul here.

51:24.498 --> 51:27.209
It seems sending the Prince
to deliver his rewards

51:27.292 --> 51:28.960
as an excuse to check on Uk…

51:30.087 --> 51:31.755
must have paid off after all.

51:37.928 --> 51:40.597
You managed to save my life
once again, Your Royal Highness.

51:41.890 --> 51:42.724
I did not.

51:43.308 --> 51:45.310
Last time, I saved you so that
you'd kill Jang Uk.

51:45.393 --> 51:46.228
But this time…

51:47.646 --> 51:51.024
Jang Uk and I joined forces
because I wanted to save Seo Yul.

51:51.108 --> 51:52.901
But just like I did last time…

51:54.236 --> 51:57.739
I'll give you something in return
to show my thanks.

52:11.336 --> 52:13.839
This is the constellation plate
from the day Jang Uk was born.

52:13.922 --> 52:15.257
Is that the King's Star I see?

52:16.716 --> 52:18.176
That is correct.

52:18.260 --> 52:21.054
The late king's son was born
under the King's Star

52:21.138 --> 52:22.722
just as Jang Gang prophesized.

52:26.434 --> 52:27.394
The son of the late king?

52:29.229 --> 52:30.063
Jang Uk…

52:30.730 --> 52:33.483
is the son of the late king
who shifted souls with Jang Gang.

52:34.151 --> 52:36.194
That is why he is under the King's Star.

52:37.112 --> 52:39.781
He also has the Gold Plaque and the letter

52:39.865 --> 52:41.992
that the late king left for his son.

52:42.075 --> 52:46.371
He's a dangerous star
who's ready to take your place anytime.

52:54.421 --> 52:56.882
Is that why you wanted me
to keep my distance from him?

52:59.259 --> 53:02.179
Please, Sire, just consider my plan…

53:03.096 --> 53:05.223
that would send Jang Uk far away.

53:18.028 --> 53:21.781
You must have used
a lot of energy, dear Mother.

53:23.450 --> 53:24.910
Your hair started turning gray

53:25.619 --> 53:27.871
after these past few days, Mother.

53:31.666 --> 53:32.500
Cho-yeon.

53:33.877 --> 53:35.462
Please prepare Bu-yeon's room for her.

53:35.545 --> 53:37.797
Is she then coming back home soon?

53:39.174 --> 53:40.634
Jang Uk gave me his word.

53:41.927 --> 53:43.053
So she'll be here soon.

53:50.060 --> 53:53.605
Young Master, how's Young Master Seo?
Is he doing all right?

53:54.231 --> 53:56.900
Yeah, I wanted to see him when he woke up.

53:56.983 --> 53:59.527
But I was worried my energy
could harm him so I had to leave.

53:59.611 --> 54:01.071
That's a relief.

54:01.780 --> 54:03.782
You did great, Young Master.

54:04.324 --> 54:05.408
You saved your friend.

54:06.826 --> 54:07.702
Have you seen her yet?

54:08.370 --> 54:09.955
- Did she go?
- Young Lady Jin?

54:11.998 --> 54:13.208
She hasn't come home yet.

54:13.833 --> 54:15.585
I thought you were at Songrim together.

54:16.503 --> 54:17.504
She hasn't come home?

54:18.922 --> 54:22.133
What? Did she really leave
without saying goodbye to Maidservant Kim?

54:22.217 --> 54:25.971
What do you mean?
Did she return home to Jinyowon?

54:26.054 --> 54:29.808
Uh-huh. I promised Lady Jin
that I would send her back.

54:29.891 --> 54:31.226
Did you really now?

54:32.018 --> 54:34.980
Oh! My dear, give me your hand.

54:35.480 --> 54:36.606
Your hand!

54:37.315 --> 54:40.527
Foolish boy! What do you mean?
Send her back? She's not an object!

54:40.610 --> 54:43.196
I only said that because she's going back
to where she came from.

54:43.280 --> 54:45.865
But the place that
she's supposed to be is right here.

54:48.535 --> 54:51.454
There was… never a place for her here.

54:57.168 --> 54:58.253
Oh, goodness.

54:58.920 --> 55:01.172
He'll never know
what he's given up until it's gone.

55:02.674 --> 55:04.801
You will keep changing your mind.

55:05.927 --> 55:07.178
This foolish boy!

55:08.430 --> 55:09.848
He has to come to his senses.

55:15.645 --> 55:16.521
So she…

55:18.064 --> 55:19.232
left right away.

55:19.316 --> 55:22.902
Your useless brazier's leaving as nothing
more than ashes after burning out.

55:22.986 --> 55:25.196
I'll disperse into the wind, and you…

55:27.282 --> 55:28.783
can freeze to death all alone.

55:44.507 --> 55:45.592
So her mother…

55:46.843 --> 55:48.345
wouldn't do that again, right?

56:06.446 --> 56:07.280
So that…

56:08.031 --> 56:09.407
you don't get confused anymore.

56:10.658 --> 56:13.787
I will make it
a warm, comfortable place for you.

56:18.917 --> 56:20.001
See! It's warm.

56:39.396 --> 56:40.605
She left this here.

56:40.688 --> 56:42.565
I was gonna use it as an excuse.

56:46.111 --> 56:47.320
She should be there now, right?

56:59.624 --> 57:01.543
You can go ahead
and turn off the last lantern.

57:01.626 --> 57:03.837
Since you're
a great priestess of Jinyowon,

57:03.920 --> 57:05.713
use your great divine power
to turn it off.

57:12.762 --> 57:15.014
Look, right there! Look, I did it again!

57:41.833 --> 57:43.126
Yul.

57:54.053 --> 57:56.473
Young Master, are you finally awake then?

57:59.017 --> 58:00.101
What happened to me?

58:00.185 --> 58:01.895
You almost died back there.

58:02.479 --> 58:05.148
You've been unconscious
for three whole days now.

58:10.111 --> 58:11.321
So-i, is she okay?

58:12.906 --> 58:15.408
Do you mean that girl you tried to save?

58:15.492 --> 58:16.534
She died.

58:19.329 --> 58:21.831
Lord Dang-gu retrieved her body for you.

58:21.915 --> 58:24.334
Master Heo and your friends managed to

58:24.417 --> 58:26.211
remove the blood parasite from your body.

58:27.670 --> 58:28.755
They were able to remove it?

58:29.631 --> 58:30.465
Yes.

58:42.685 --> 58:43.686
You're finally awake now?

58:45.855 --> 58:48.483
We almost didn't make it, Yul.

58:49.275 --> 58:52.529
Young Lady Jin was vital
in clearing the blood parasite.

58:53.863 --> 58:56.282
Had I known
the thing inside you was so dangerous,

58:56.366 --> 58:57.659
I wouldn't have kept it a secret.

58:58.284 --> 58:59.202
I'm sorry for…

58:59.744 --> 59:02.622
asking you to go to
Danhyanggok in that state.

59:06.459 --> 59:08.378
We agreed we would go together, but…

59:12.131 --> 59:13.049
we couldn't.

59:17.554 --> 59:20.473
Master Lee,
Seo Yul's regained consciousness.

59:22.183 --> 59:24.644
- Master Lee?
- This is Master Lee.

59:24.727 --> 59:26.729
He's been the one taking care of you.

59:27.522 --> 59:28.898
Young Master Seo does know him.

59:29.399 --> 59:31.693
After all, he was the master
of Master Heo.

59:31.776 --> 59:34.237
The "frivolous Yeom"
that you always told me stories about

59:34.737 --> 59:36.406
was really Master Heo?

59:36.489 --> 59:38.616
When Yeom was your age,
he was adorable too.

59:39.200 --> 59:40.618
A little.

59:42.036 --> 59:44.872
He was the physician who took care of me
for three years when I was ill.

59:45.540 --> 59:48.459
He's Daeho's best physician,
so you'll be better soon.

59:48.543 --> 59:50.795
Bu-yeon, go bring Yeom over here.

59:51.379 --> 59:52.922
He'll be thrilled to hear Yul's awake.

59:53.006 --> 59:54.173
Yes, Master.

01:00:01.639 --> 01:00:04.100
You've regained nearly
all of your torrent of energy,

01:00:04.183 --> 01:00:05.351
so you'll recover soon.

01:00:06.894 --> 01:00:08.396
If you took care of her back then,

01:00:09.522 --> 01:00:11.190
Jin Bu-yeon must be someone you know well.

01:00:12.442 --> 01:00:16.029
You just woke up and you're seriously
asking me about Jin Bu-yeon.

01:00:16.696 --> 01:00:18.698
You're right. I am the one who saved her.

01:00:19.282 --> 01:00:21.909
And I promise I'll take care of you too.

01:00:26.164 --> 01:00:29.000
Young Lady Jin
is at Sejukwon in Songrim?

01:00:29.083 --> 01:00:33.171
Yeah. Her mother believes
that she's still at Uk's house,

01:00:33.254 --> 01:00:35.548
while Uk must think she went to Jinyowon.

01:00:36.633 --> 01:00:38.843
Is it really over between them?

01:00:39.886 --> 01:00:43.598
Whenever she would leave our house,
he would go and bring her back every time.

01:00:44.182 --> 01:00:46.434
And she must be choosing
to stay in Songrim

01:00:46.517 --> 01:00:48.770
because she's been waiting
for him to come bring her back.

01:00:49.395 --> 01:00:51.105
- Hmm.
- Let's just let them be.

01:00:54.442 --> 01:00:56.027
Oh, Lord Park's here.

01:00:56.110 --> 01:00:58.655
You only appreciate someone
once they're gone.

01:00:58.738 --> 01:01:00.531
Lord Park!

01:01:01.115 --> 01:01:02.617
How did your trip go?

01:01:02.700 --> 01:01:03.951
You must be exhausted.

01:01:04.911 --> 01:01:07.830
I hurried here since I knew
you would be waiting.

01:01:07.914 --> 01:01:10.583
Oh, my! He's watching us.

01:01:11.709 --> 01:01:13.127
Come inside.

01:01:15.797 --> 01:01:17.548
You shouldn't be walking around just yet.

01:01:19.550 --> 01:01:21.094
Had you already known who that girl…

01:01:22.595 --> 01:01:23.429
actually was?

01:01:25.223 --> 01:01:27.934
You must have known then
if you pulled her body out of the lake.

01:01:28.017 --> 01:01:29.686
So you recognized her face then.

01:01:31.104 --> 01:01:34.315
Well, you did say you had met Naksu
when she was living in Danghyanggok.

01:01:34.399 --> 01:01:36.317
You chose to save her despite knowing who…

01:01:38.403 --> 01:01:39.237
she really was?

01:01:40.405 --> 01:01:41.239
Seo Yul.

01:01:42.031 --> 01:01:44.492
If you are the only one
who knows the truth about her,

01:01:44.992 --> 01:01:46.411
pretend you know nothing.

01:01:48.371 --> 01:01:51.708
The soul of Naksu will disappear soon.

01:01:52.500 --> 01:01:55.545
Once the soul of Jin Bu-yeon,
the true owner of that body, awakens,

01:01:56.045 --> 01:01:58.506
Naksu's soul will no longer exist.

01:01:59.465 --> 01:02:00.299
What?

01:02:02.260 --> 01:02:03.636
What are you saying right now?

01:02:04.220 --> 01:02:06.097
Right now, there are
two souls in that body.

01:02:06.723 --> 01:02:08.850
But the body is Jin Bu-yeon's.

01:02:10.435 --> 01:02:12.603
Contrary to my original intentions,

01:02:12.687 --> 01:02:15.189
everything has gone
in favor of Bu-yeon's will.

01:02:15.773 --> 01:02:18.025
Once Naksu's energy is entirely consumed…

01:02:20.319 --> 01:02:21.404
she will disappear.

01:02:30.580 --> 01:02:33.791
Young Lady Heo!
Master Heo's asking where you are.

01:02:35.126 --> 01:02:36.127
Thank you, Sun-i.

01:02:37.545 --> 01:02:39.630
I'll be there soon. You go now.

01:02:41.340 --> 01:02:42.175
Uh…

01:02:45.094 --> 01:02:48.431
That looked like
Young Master Seo's letter from before.

01:02:49.348 --> 01:02:50.391
Is she taking a look?

01:02:55.772 --> 01:02:56.898
Naksu is that…

01:03:00.026 --> 01:03:01.068
woman then?

01:03:07.283 --> 01:03:09.118
If someone is so dear to you,

01:03:09.202 --> 01:03:12.747
don't ever think of
letting them go and abandoning them.

01:03:12.830 --> 01:03:15.750
But the place that
she's supposed to be is right here.

01:03:23.883 --> 01:03:26.677
It turned off. Did she break it
when she was messing with it?

01:03:30.723 --> 01:03:32.141
It keeps flickering.

01:03:33.142 --> 01:03:34.519
It must be losing its mind.

01:03:35.186 --> 01:03:37.814
To tell you the truth,
I was hoping that…

01:03:38.689 --> 01:03:40.399
even though you didn't need me…

01:03:42.193 --> 01:03:43.820
you still chose to take me with.

01:03:51.619 --> 01:03:52.912
I would be crazy…

01:03:54.872 --> 01:03:56.290
if I went back there again.

01:04:01.254 --> 01:04:04.090
If you drink that, that means
we are officially married, all right?

01:04:04.173 --> 01:04:06.092
Uk. Drink up.

01:04:11.055 --> 01:04:12.348
I'm always going to stay.

01:04:13.266 --> 01:04:14.600
Summon some fireflies.

01:04:14.684 --> 01:04:16.936
That is definitely
not an easy thing to do, you know.

01:04:17.562 --> 01:04:19.438
Get a hold of yourself, jeez.

01:04:24.026 --> 01:04:25.319
I'm going mad.

01:04:29.740 --> 01:04:32.785
Mother knows you are still here.
She told me to get you.

01:04:32.869 --> 01:04:34.328
I was going to go leave today.

01:04:35.538 --> 01:04:36.706
I ran into Master Lee.

01:04:36.789 --> 01:04:38.666
He's the one taking care of Seo Yul.

01:04:38.749 --> 01:04:40.668
I wanted to see Seo Yul wake up.

01:04:42.837 --> 01:04:44.964
Jang Uk thinks
you're in Jinyowon right now.

01:04:46.757 --> 01:04:48.259
So he's really not coming.

01:04:50.511 --> 01:04:51.345
I know.

01:04:52.972 --> 01:04:54.515
Let's go.

01:04:55.933 --> 01:04:58.769
I need to return
Songrim's Spirit Plaque before I go.

01:04:58.853 --> 01:05:00.104
It's over at Jeongjingak.

01:05:00.187 --> 01:05:02.064
I'll go get it quickly. Wait for me.

01:05:02.648 --> 01:05:03.482
Uh…

01:05:25.922 --> 01:05:27.840
You know you could get
100 flogs for losing this?

01:05:34.305 --> 01:05:35.640
I didn't lose it.

01:05:35.723 --> 01:05:36.557
Why?

01:05:37.224 --> 01:05:38.684
Do you want me to lose it and get flogged?

01:05:43.940 --> 01:05:45.149
I went to Jinyowon,

01:05:46.525 --> 01:05:47.443
but you weren't there.

01:05:48.569 --> 01:05:50.863
Were… you looking for me?

01:05:52.907 --> 01:05:53.741
Why?

01:05:55.952 --> 01:05:58.287
The lantern turned off. But then…

01:05:59.705 --> 01:06:00.581
it turned back on again.

01:06:00.665 --> 01:06:02.750
Lantern? The one in your study?

01:06:02.833 --> 01:06:05.294
It kept flickering on and off
like it had gone crazy.

01:06:08.255 --> 01:06:09.298
It must be useless then.

01:06:10.174 --> 01:06:11.258
Just throw it away.

01:06:12.259 --> 01:06:13.094
That's right.

01:06:13.761 --> 01:06:15.096
It belongs to Jinyowon.

01:06:17.181 --> 01:06:18.349
Then you can just send it back.

01:06:18.432 --> 01:06:20.893
Since you think I left you
because I have no use for you,

01:06:21.519 --> 01:06:22.728
I suppose I should

01:06:23.562 --> 01:06:25.690
explain why I wanted to use you
so you'll understand.

01:06:28.275 --> 01:06:29.443
I took you home because…

01:06:31.070 --> 01:06:32.863
I was hoping
you'd take out what's within me.

01:06:33.531 --> 01:06:34.365
I know.

01:06:35.074 --> 01:06:36.951
You said you had to
remove it to be at peace.

01:06:38.536 --> 01:06:39.370
Right.

01:06:40.538 --> 01:06:41.789
I wanted to find some peace.

01:06:43.666 --> 01:06:44.709
But once it's removed…

01:06:46.335 --> 01:06:47.336
it would kill me.

01:06:48.921 --> 01:06:50.631
Don't blame yourself
because you couldn't have known.

01:06:51.173 --> 01:06:53.009
It's my fault for not
being honest with you.

01:06:53.926 --> 01:06:55.886
At first, I didn't think
you needed to know.

01:06:57.013 --> 01:06:59.724
And later on, I couldn't tell someone
so determined to protect me.

01:07:02.768 --> 01:07:03.644
So what about now?

01:07:04.353 --> 01:07:05.688
I told you I have no use for you.

01:07:09.108 --> 01:07:10.776
So what I really mean by that is I am…

01:07:12.987 --> 01:07:14.238
very grateful for you.

01:07:15.614 --> 01:07:16.991
And I'm sorry for how I've acted.

01:07:21.120 --> 01:07:21.996
If that's true…

01:07:23.247 --> 01:07:25.207
then I'm glad you don't have
a use for me anymore.

01:07:26.709 --> 01:07:28.627
I was miserable
believing you abandoned me.

01:07:29.545 --> 01:07:32.423
But now you're thanking me
and apologizing.

01:07:34.341 --> 01:07:35.634
You came here just to say that?

01:07:37.136 --> 01:07:39.013
I heard you clearly, and now I'm going.

01:07:40.598 --> 01:07:42.224
Can't say I'd wish you a good life though.

01:07:45.061 --> 01:07:46.312
What do you want from me?

01:07:46.896 --> 01:07:49.106
You want me to wait for you
to change your mind someday?

01:07:49.607 --> 01:07:52.526
I never want to see you again.

01:07:52.610 --> 01:07:54.153
Or I might just rip it out of you.

01:07:55.237 --> 01:07:56.197
I'm not done.

01:07:56.947 --> 01:07:58.699
I told you I came
because the lantern was flickering.

01:07:58.783 --> 01:08:00.493
- Why does that matter though?
- It means…

01:08:04.872 --> 01:08:06.248
when it's on, I feel like I'm sane.

01:08:07.708 --> 01:08:08.584
I understand…

01:08:09.877 --> 01:08:11.879
that I have to send you back
like I had promised.

01:08:12.463 --> 01:08:14.381
But as soon as it turns off, I go insane.

01:08:15.007 --> 01:08:16.092
I want to see you.

01:08:18.219 --> 01:08:19.678
That's why I came all this way.

01:08:28.437 --> 01:08:29.271
So what?

01:08:33.025 --> 01:08:33.859
What about now?

01:08:35.861 --> 01:08:37.655
If you're leaving because you're furious…

01:08:41.200 --> 01:08:42.576
then I'll get myself together and…

01:08:45.579 --> 01:08:46.413
let you go.

01:09:02.138 --> 01:09:02.972
What's that?

01:09:03.055 --> 01:09:04.390
I blew it out.

01:09:08.394 --> 01:09:09.520
To turn the light off.

01:10:37.024 --> 01:10:39.944
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:10:40.027 --> 01:10:41.487
I knew when I saw you.

01:10:41.570 --> 01:10:42.488
You're my husband.

01:10:43.030 --> 01:10:44.323
"I promise to be good to her."

01:10:44.406 --> 01:10:46.158
"So please allow me
to marry your daughter, Bu-yeon."

01:10:46.242 --> 01:10:48.744
Just let her
with the person she wishes to be with,

01:10:48.827 --> 01:10:49.662
even if it's brief.

01:10:49.745 --> 01:10:51.622
If you do not intend
to fight me over the Gold Plaque,

01:10:51.705 --> 01:10:53.123
go up north, Jang Uk.

01:10:53.207 --> 01:10:55.793
…and have ultimately decided
to accept this fight

01:10:55.876 --> 01:10:57.127
to protect what I must.

01:10:57.211 --> 01:11:00.047
I will soon invite Your Highness
to one of our meetings.

01:11:00.130 --> 01:11:02.800
Tell me what you need
and I'll help you, whatever it may be.

01:11:02.883 --> 01:11:04.385
Naksu's soul will soon disappear,

01:11:04.468 --> 01:11:06.804
and that body will solely
belong to Jin Bu-yeon.

01:11:06.887 --> 01:11:09.974
Please allow me
to test your powers.
